{"t":"Curse","s":"curse-738ca","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Curse_91660d.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><i>This page is about the <b>spell</b> Curse. For the Charm, see Curse (Charm)</i> For the Special Condition, see <a href=\"#/wiki/Cursed\">Cursed</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Curse</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Curse\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Curse_91660d.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">utori mort</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damagetype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Magic Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Death Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cursed_Icon_3dcdcb.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Death Damage</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">30</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Attack Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Attack_Cooldown_61cf3f.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Attack (2 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">40 seconds</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">75</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"basepower\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Base Power</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">120</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.70<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 8, 2010<br/>Winter Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p>Inflicts <a href=\"#/wiki/Cursed\">cursed</a> conditions on the target.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\">\n<blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>Drawing upon the powers of darkness is always walking a thin line. This spell focuses amounts of raw dark power to curse an enemy with deathly magic that more and more destroys the victim's body. Attacking inner organs, it becomes more and more dangerous the longer it can do its evil work. A victim is well advised to seek out a cure as soon as possible before the dark magic can reach its dreadful peak.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>This spell takes into account the <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">Level</a> and Magic Level to determine how much damage it will deal to the target. The damage is a series of constant values, where each value is followed by a 20% higher next value. The damage is the same for both creatures and players. The last damage value, the final dreadful peak, is calculated by multiplying the last damage value with a percentage ranging from 1 to 120%.\n</p>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"scene_table canvas\" style=\"padding:0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"caster-south\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171019130455&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mage_Outfit_Male_White_7e3ebc.gif\"/></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect no_effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"missile_area\" data-horiz=\"300\" data-vert=\"300\" style=\"width:300%;height:300%;\">\n<div data-anim-dir=\"south-east\" style=\"position:relative;padding:0;width: 32px;height: 32px;z-index:2;animation:south-east 1s infinite !important;\">\n<div class=\"sprite\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20180903194017&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;frame=4\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Death_Missile_d0d282.gif\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"target\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Spells\">Related Spells</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-hea